/// Copy for Premium Pages ("Treści", spec premium-pages §5).
///
/// English and Polish are authored at the call sites; this module gives
/// every other selectable locale an explicit translation, so none of these
/// strings falls back to English. Later Pages packages append their keys
/// here.
///
/// C0 (the VIP rosette slice): the "VIP doesn't mean verified" sheet a
/// header rosette opens (R14) and the rosette button's hint.
/// `identity.officialLegend` is a context key (the sheet's legend row for the
/// official account mark), resolved by `AppLocalizations.contextualText`.
///
/// C4 (the 43-locale copy pass): every string of the Treści wall, Find
/// Pages, the Page profile, create, settings, the composer, the post
/// detail, the Page notices and the Pages upsell. `pages.*` keys are
/// context keys; `<stem>.<category>` keys are the CLDR plural forms that
/// `AppLocalizations.pluralTemplate` reads (zero and two hold the forms for
/// exactly 0 and 2 in every language). Keys another catalog module already
/// translates for all 41 locales are not repeated here.
///
/// "VIP" and "YO Voice" stay as written in every language.
